  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "According to the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b58774e01647a1dce8585af0b0e3da55f676e12ce10b27c06a6c9935db9f0739.png] \n\n \n \n\n \n \n**Sings**\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n**Change sings**\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n**Option 1 :** 26 × 18 ÷ 39 + 4 - 111 = 100\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n26 - 18 + 39 × 4 ÷ 111 = 100\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n26 - 18 + 39 × 0.0360 = 100\n\n26 - 18 + 1.405 = 100\n\n27.405 - 18 = 100\n\n9.405 = 100 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n**Option 2 : ****26 + 18 - 39 × 4 ÷ 111 = 119**\n\n**After interchange the signs;**\n\n**26 × 18 ÷ 39 - 4 + 111 = 119**\n\n**By BODMAS rule**\n\n**26 × 0.461 - 4 + 111 = 119**\n\n**12 - 4 + 111 = 119**\n\n**123 - 4 = 119**\n\n**119 = 119**** (LHS = RHS)**\n\n**Option 3 :** 26 - 18 + 39 × 4 ÷ 111 = 203\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n26 ÷ 18 × 39 - 4 + 111 = 203\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n26 ÷ 18 × 39 - 4 + 111 = 203\n\n1.45 × 39 - 4 + 111 = 203\n\n56.5 - 4 + 111 = 203\n\n167.5 - 4 = 203\n\n163.5 = 203 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n**Option 4 :** 26 - 18 ÷ 39 + 4 × 111 = 40\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n26 ÷ 18 + 39 × 4 - 111 = 40\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n1.4 + 39 × 4 - 111 = 40\n\n1.4 + 39 × 4 - 111 = 40\n\n1.4 + 156 – 111 = 40\n\n157.4 – 111 = 40\n\n46.4 = 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, the answer is **“****26 + 18 - 39 × 4 ÷ 111 = 119****”**.",
